WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The QNX interface shows the webcam, current sign and transcript.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Recorded hand landmarks are replayed. The classifier recognizes C and adds it after a one-second hold.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The classifier recognizes A. The transcript reads CA.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The classifier recognizes T and adds it to the transcript.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Three recognized letters form CAT.
